\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Illustrative multi-site inventory environment using Singapore as an example geography. Each site represents a local factory, warehouse, or inventory location operated by an inventory-control agent that observes local inventory state and demand forecasts. The simulator updates demand, replenishment lead times, lateral transshipment, feasibility checks, and cost accounting. The proposed method generates executable policy logic for these agents, and candidate policies are evaluated using cost, service, and coordination measures.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
